{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-110000-pcs-clear-water-beads-sold-via-shein-2604-0218","content_id":"7c32d49e-39f8-4179-a50b-be92bea4b8d4","description":"Product Recall for 110,000 Pcs Clear Water Beads presenting a high risk of asphyxiation.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"d396274d-5049-49c9-9b2e-98eff352400c","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-06-15T12:28:22+01:00","id":"d396274d-5049-49c9-9b2e-98eff352400c","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-06-15T12:28:22+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a2fe1d6c39255c595b5086e/2604-0218-product-recall-110_000pcs-clear-water-beads.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: 110,000 Pcs Clear Water Beads sold via Shein</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a high risk of asphyxiation. If the product is swallowed in its hydrated form, it can block a young child’s airway.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by SHEIN. The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Shein).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Decorative articles/Homeware/Gardenware - Ornament Accessories</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Shein SKU</td>\n      <td>sh2407125001787408</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Other product code</td>\n      <td>PB2409070290330</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Full Shein listing name</td>\n      <td>‘110,000 Pcs ClearWater Beads For Vases Gel Water Gel Beads For Vase Filler Plant Floating Beads Pearls Floating Candles Wedding And Home Decoration’</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Clear water gel beads in plastic packaging.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_d396274d-5049-49c9-9b2e-98eff352400c\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a2fe1d6c39255c595b5086e/2604-0218-product-recall-110_000pcs-clear-water-beads.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a high risk of asphyxiation. If the product is swallowed in its hydrated form, it can block a young child’s airway.</p>\n\n<p>OPSS has published a Product Safety Alert for water beads, which can be accessed at : <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-alert-water-beads-psa7\">https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-alert-water-beads-psa7</a>.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by SHEIN.</p>\n\n<p>We recommend that consumers stop using the product immediately and keep it out of reach of children. Affected users have been contacted directly by the marketplace.</p>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Shein).</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2604-0218</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Office for Product Safety and Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"Updated to include recall of the product from end users.","public_timestamp":"2026-06-15T13:36:16Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-07T15:47:29Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"household-decorative-articles","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users","removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-05-07","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-05-07T16:47:29+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-110000-pcs-clear-water-beads-sold-via-shein-2604-0218","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-110000-pcs-clear-water-beads-sold-via-shein-2604-0218","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-110000-pcs-clear-water-beads-sold-via-shein-2604-0218","content_id":"7c32d49e-39f8-4179-a50b-be92bea4b8d4","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-06-15T13:36:16Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: 110,000 Pcs Clear Water Beads sold via Shein (2604-0218)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-110000-pcs-clear-water-beads-sold-via-shein-2604-0218","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert ty